  <h1>About This Site</h1>

  <h2>Purpose</h2>
  <p>The Agni Yoga World Community website is a volunteer-run directory and information hub for groups and individuals working with the Agni Yoga (Living Ethics) Teachings worldwide. It is operated by the White Mountain Education Association, Inc. (WMEA), a 501(c)(3) nonprofit based in Prescott, Arizona.</p>

  <h2>Independence</h2>
  <p>This site does not represent any single group or lineage. Listed organizations operate independently and are responsible for their own content, events, and activities. Listing here implies no endorsement beyond confirmation that the group works with the Agni Yoga Teachings.</p>

  <h2>How to Get Listed</h2>
  <p>If you represent an Agni Yoga study group and would like to be included in the directory, contact us via the <a href="/connect/">contact form</a> with your group's name, location, contact details, and a brief description. We review all requests and respond within a reasonable time.</p>

  <h2>How to Submit News</h2>
  <p>To submit a news item or event announcement, use the <a href="/connect/">contact form</a> and select "Submit news or event." Please include the title, date, location, and a short description.</p>

  <h2>Corrections</h2>
  <p>If you notice inaccurate information about your group or any other content on this site, please contact us and we will correct it promptly.</p>

